					<h2 class="static__text__title">Glare Free</h2>
					<p class="static__text__desc">
						See intense blacks and whites in all their glory, no matter what's shining on your screen. Our glare-free technology reduces light reflections, so you can enjoy your favorite content without distracting shine.<sup><a id="staticGlareFreeDescription01" href="#staticDescription02" class="static__disc-txt" title="see disclaimer">2</a></sup>
